--- Third-party notices -------------------------------------------------------

This mod is a standalone addon. It bundles no third-party code: Botania, Just
Enough Items and Mystical Agriculture are compile-only dependencies and are not
redistributed with it.

Botania (c) Vazkii - "Botania License". This addon compiles only against the
Botania API (vazkii.botania.api), which the license's API Clause exempts from
its attribution and copyleft requirements. No Botania code is included here.

Mystical Agriculture (c) BlakeBr0 - MIT. Referenced only by item identifier
strings at runtime.

